{"id":"8e70eff045618bab","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-differential.md","title":"Differential","display":"df-differential — Differential","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-differential","aliases":["58-df-differential","Differential"],"display":"df-differential — Differential","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-differential"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-differential</span><span>Differential</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-differential — Differential"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4aec613831b7dd67\" href=\"?note=4aec613831b7dd67\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md\">../batch19/58-df-tangent.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>固定一次调用使用的光滑结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\">\\(n,m\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\)</span>。这些结构是上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 的参数，不在不同子式中重新选择。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(M,N)=\\{g\\in N^M:\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(g,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\}\">\\(C^\\infty(M,N)=\\{g\\in N^M:\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(g,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_M=C^\\infty(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M;\\mathbb R)\">\\(A_M=C^\\infty(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M;\\mathbb R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_N=C^\\infty(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N;\\mathbb R)\">\\(A_N=C^\\infty(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N;\\mathbb R)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(M,\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^\\infty(M,\\mathbb R)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^\\infty(N,\\mathbb R)\">\\(C^\\infty(N,\\mathbb R)\\)</span> 分别缩写这两个已指定的代数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_pM=T_p(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M)\">\\(T_pM=T_p(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_qN=T_q(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N)\">\\(T_qN=T_q(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4aec613831b7dd67\" href=\"?note=4aec613831b7dd67\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md\">../batch19/58-df-tangent.md</a> 的导子集合。对于同一定义域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 上的实值函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(av+bw)(h)=a\\,v(h)+b\\,w(h)\">\\((av+bw)(h)=a\\,v(h)+b\\,w(h)\\)</span>，逐点和及数乘均为由此确定的函数图。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in C^\\infty(M,N)\">\\(f\\in C^\\infty(M,N)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in M\">\\(p\\in M\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为候选集合函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Linear}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Linear}_S\\)</span> 的三参数接口在本文件用于上述实导子空间；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"df_p\">\\(df_p\\)</span> 由下式显式构造，不是额外选择的数据。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Differential}\">\\(\\mathrm{Differential}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Immersion}\">\\(\\mathrm{Immersion}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}linear}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Linear}_S(L,T_pM,T_qN)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nL\\in(T_qN)^{T_pM}\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall v,w\\in T_pM\\;(L(av+bw)=aL(v)+bL(w)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}linear}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Linear}_S(L,T_pM,T_qN)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nL\\in(T_qN)^{T_pM}\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall v,w\\in T_pM\\;(L(av+bw)=aL(v)+bL(w)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}map}\\vdash\nf\\in C^\\infty(M,N)\\land p\\in M\\to\ndf_p=\\{\\langle v,\\{\\langle h,v(h\\circ f)\\rangle:h\\in A_N\\}\\rangle:v\\in T_pM\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}map}\\vdash\nf\\in C^\\infty(M,N)\\land p\\in M\\to\ndf_p=\\{\\langle v,\\{\\langle h,v(h\\circ f)\\rangle:h\\in A_N\\}\\rangle:v\\in T_pM\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Differential}_S(L,f,p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;f\\in C^\\infty(M,N)\\land p\\in M\\land\nL\\in(T_{f(p)}N)^{T_pM}\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_S(L,T_pM,T_{f(p)}N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in T_pM\\;\\forall h\\in A_N\\;(L(v)(h)=v(h\\circ f)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Differential}_S(L,f,p)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;f\\in C^\\infty(M,N)\\land p\\in M\\land\nL\\in(T_{f(p)}N)^{T_pM}\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_S(L,T_pM,T_{f(p)}N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\in T_pM\\;\\forall h\\in A_N\\;(L(v)(h)=v(h\\circ f)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}immersion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Immersion}_S(f,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Differential}_S(df_p,f,p)\\land\\forall v,w\\in T_pM\\;(df_p(v)=df_p(w)\\to v=w).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}immersion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Immersion}_S(f,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Differential}_S(df_p,f,p)\\land\\forall v,w\\in T_pM\\;(df_p(v)=df_p(w)\\to v=w).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Differential: linear approximation of map at point; Jacobian generalization</li>\n<li>The tangent map is covariant: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"df_p:T_pM\\to T_{f(p)}N\">\\(df_p:T_pM\\to T_{f(p)}N\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The dual map is the pullback <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(df_p)^*:T_{f(p)}^*N\\to T_p^*M\">\\((df_p)^*:T_{f(p)}^*N\\to T_p^*M\\)</span> and is contravariant.</li>\n<li>The chain rule is a theorem about these differentials, not part of the definition.</li>\n<li>Rank: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}(df_p)\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}(df_p)\\)</span> = dimension of image tangent space</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lee, Smooth Manifolds</li>\n<li>Guillemin and Pollack, Differential Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"cd9981d8428c2629","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md","status":"resolved","id":"4aec613831b7dd67","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-tangent.md","status":"resolved","id":"4aec613831b7dd67","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T_pM=T_p(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M)$、$T_qN=T_q(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N)$ 使用 [[../batch19/58-df-tangent.md]] 的导子集合。对于同一定义域 $A$ 上的实值函数，$(av+bw)(h)=a\\,v(h)+b\\,w(h)$，逐点和及数乘均为由此确定的函数图。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\omega_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty(M,N)=\\{g\\in N^M:\\mathrm{SmoothMapStructure}_S(g,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,n,N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N,m)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A_M=C^\\infty(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M;\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"A_N=C^\\infty(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N;\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty(M,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"C^\\infty(N,\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"T_pM=T_p(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M)","display":false},{"tex":"T_qN=T_q(N,\\tau_N,\\mathcal A_N)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"(av+bw)(h)=a\\,v(h)+b\\,w(h)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in C^\\infty(M,N)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Linear}_S","display":false},{"tex":"df_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Differential}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Immersion}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}tangent\\text{-}linear}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Linear}_S(L,T_pM,T_qN)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nL\\in(T_qN)^{T_pM}\\land\n\\forall a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\forall v,w\\in T_pM\\;(L(av+bw)=aL(v)+bL(w)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}map}\\vdash\nf\\in C^\\infty(M,N)\\land p\\in M\\to\ndf_p=\\{\\langle v,\\{\\langle h,v(h\\circ f)\\rangle:h\\in A_N\\}\\rangle:v\\in T_pM\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Differential}_S(L,f,p)\\leftrightarrow{}&f\\in C^\\infty(M,N)\\land p\\in M\\land\nL\\in(T_{f(p)}N)^{T_pM}\\land\\mathrm{Linear}_S(L,T_pM,T_{f(p)}N)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall v\\in T_pM\\;\\forall h\\in A_N\\;(L(v)(h)=v(h\\circ f)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}differential\\text{-}immersion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Immersion}_S(f,p)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Differential}_S(df_p,f,p)\\land\\forall v,w\\in T_pM\\;(df_p(v)=df_p(w)\\to v=w).","display":true},{"tex":"df_p:T_pM\\to T_{f(p)}N","display":false},{"tex":"(df_p)^*:T_{f(p)}^*N\\to T_p^*M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}(df_p)","display":false}],"bytes":3014,"backlinks":[{"id":"c800033782eba35e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"85ef85f035e9b2d4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-428","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[